      "entry": "Move",
      "alt": "Two location cards (Merchant District and Waterfront District) joined by an arrow, illustrating movement between connecting locations.",
      "info": "<p><b>Merchant District</b> — Location · Arkham (Central). <i>During your turn, if there are exactly 1 or 2 investigators in the game: Move to a connecting location. (Limit once per round.)</i></p><p><b>Waterfront District</b> — Location · Arkham. <i>With its streets perpetually flooded, the former Rivertown district is a ghost town…</i></p>"
    },
