      "entry": "Victory X",
      "alt": "Two cards worth victory points: the enemy Naomi O’Bannion and the location Orne Library.",
      "info": "<p><b>Naomi O’Bannion</b> — Enemy · Humanoid, Syndicate, Elite. Retaliate. Spend 1 resource: Parley. <b>Victory 1.</b></p><p><b>Orne Library</b> — Location · Miskatonic. “Draw 3 cards. (Limit once per game.)” <b>Victory 1.</b></p>"
    },
